bold><italic>R</italic></bold>. Each permutation test is based on 10,000 permutations of each dataset.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="pone-0006624-t006" position="float"><object-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1371/journal.pone.0006624.t006</object-id><label>Table 6</label><caption><title>Mixed Models via Restricted Maximum Likelihood (RML) Treating Time as Categorical.</title></caption><alternatives><graphic id="pone-0006624-t006-6" xlink:href="pone.0006624.t006"/><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><colgroup span="1"><col align="left" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/></colgroup><thead><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td colspan="3" align="left" rowspan="1">Actual Analysis</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Null</td><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">Imposed Treatment Effect</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Mixed I</bold></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Observed Estimate</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Observed p-value</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Permuted p-value</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Empirical <italic>&#x003b1;</italic></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Estimate</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Power</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">RCT 1</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.18</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5&#x000d7;10<sup>&#x02212;5</sup></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5&#x000d7;10<sup>&#x02212;5</sup></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.0424</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.89</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.422</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">RCT 2</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.87</td><td align=